Every payer may support a broader-nonpharmacologic-intervention-array.
A broader-nonpharmacologic-intervention-example includes an exercise-example and includes a multidisciplinary-rehabilitation-example and includes a mind-body-intervention-example and includes a cognitive-behavioral-therapy-example and includes a known-effective-complementary-and-integrative-medicine-therapy-example.
A known-effective-complementary-and-integrative-medicine-therapy-example includes an acupuncture-example and includes a spinal-manipulation-example.
